crises and defeat the enemies.  This game provides a dual weapon system. The knife is mainly for fast combos, and the greatsword is for high damage and large range attacks. Each weapon has its own unique attack actions and rhythms.  Besides the time stop mechanism, there is also an acceleration mode. In this mode, all the player's actions will be accelerated, which enables the player to better interrupt the enemies' fatal attacks at the appropriate time.  In addition, the game also has mechanisms such as shield parrying, perfect defense, blade clashing, and bullet slashing, which test the player's timing of operations. Of course, players can also use gorgeous combos to suppress the enemies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093640/extras/443c7d10fad7caa85eeea71df2b18698.avif?t=1755245825\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
